e;text-decoration-thickness:0.0625rem;text-decoration-color:#125C68;text-underline-offset:0.25rem;color:#125C68;-webkit-transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out;transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out;word-break:break-word;}.css-eone0e:hover{color:#595959;text-decoration-color:#595959;}</style><a href="https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/pets/a34774318/boy-cat-names/" target="_blank" data-vars-ga-outbound-link="https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/pets/a34774318/boy-cat-names/" data-vars-ga-ux-element="Hyperlink" data-vars-ga-call-to-action="furry friend" class="body-link css-eone0e et3p2gv0">furry friend</a> who makes the cutest muffins in the world, we don't blame you for wanting to post a hundred photos every day. Just look at them: those big eyes that stare deep into your soul (especially when you rattle the treat bag), that mischievously twitching tail, that absolutely irresistible furry belly. It's practically a public service to share them with the world!</p><style data-emotion="css 1nd4gv7">.css-1nd4gv7{font-size:1.1875rem;line-height:1.6;font-family:Charter,Charter-roboto,Charter-local,Georgia,Times,Serif;}.css-1nd4gv7 em{font-style:italic;font-family:Charter,Charter-styleitalic-roboto,Charter-styleitalic-local,Georgia,Times,Serif;}.css-1nd4gv7 strong{font-family:Charter,Charter-weightbold-roboto,Charter-weightbold-local,Georgia,Times,Serif;font-weight:bold;}</style><p data-journey-content="true" data-node-id="1" class="css-1nd4gv7 et3p2gv0">But while filling up your camera role with cuteness is a little too easy, coming up with something to write in the caption can be much tougher. Just typing &quot;gaaaaah!&quot; into the text box doesn't have quite the right ring to it. Don't worry, we've got you: These <strong>cat Instagram captions</strong> will capture your friend's best side, whether your IG tends to feature their most elegant glamour shots or a selection of goofy snaps. We've included some cute and funny captions, as well as<a href="https://www.goodhousekeeping.c