eroes wear capes. Some have collars.</li><li>Yes, I am the cat's meow.</li><li>With a cat, anything is paw-sible.</li><li>Why thank you, I am purrrfect.</li><li>You had me at meow.</li><li>A cat will be your furever friend.</li><li>I want to spend all nine lives with you.</li><li>Home is where the cat is.</li></ul><h2 data-node-id="5" class="body-h2 css-8mutyz et3p2gv0">Funny Cat Captions</h2><div size="medium" data-embed="body-image" data-node-id="6" class="align-center size-medium embed css-1736von e1xqj1sx4"><div class="css-uwraif e1xqj1sx3"><img alt="yellow cat quote card" title="yellow cat quote card " loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto;" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=640:* 640w, https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=768:* 980w, https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=980:* 1120w, https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=980:* 1200w, https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=980:* 1920w" src="https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/cat-captions-feline-641095afee949.png?crop=1xw:1xh;center,top&amp;resize=980:*" class="css-0 evyp0mv0"/><div class="css-swqnqv e1xqj1sx2"><figcaption class="css-1am3yn9 enfs9c50"><span class="css-z3u5il e6iqukd2">Good Housekeeping</span></figcaption></div></div></div><ul data-node-id="7" class="css-yzf9pi et3p2gv0"><li>Cat hair is my favorite accessory.</li><li>Feline good, lookin' better.</li><li>Are you kitten me?</li><li>She came, she purred, she conquered.</li><li>I wish I loved anything as much as my cat loves catnip. </li><li>It's 