7.14.23","RUNTIME_CONCORDE_URL":"https://search.hearstapps.com","RUNTIME_PRODUCTS_URL":"https://products.hearstapps.com","RUNTIME_PRODUCTS_TIMEOUT":"10000","RUNTIME_INSURANCE_API_URL":"https://api.trvmarketplace.com/click/v1/auto","RUNTIME_INSURANCE_LICENSE_KEY":"afb7f38f-6470-445f-b583-28ae8e1ed325","RUNTIME_INSURANCE_PUBLISHER_KEY":"dGVk90VVSURz","RUNTIME_INSURANCE_ADUNIT_KEY":"jAgnNJlb","RUNTIME_INSURANCE_PANEL_ADUNIT_KEY":"DuS9oM6s","RUNTIME_FINANCE_API_URL":"https://api.trvmarketplace.com/click/v2/autoloan","RUNTIME_TRADE_TOOL_SCRIPT_URL":"https://app.blackbookinformation.com/app/shopping-tools-js/v1.js","RUNTIME_TRADE_TOOL_APP_URL":"https://app.blackbookinformation.com","RUNTIME_TRADE_TOOL_DEALER_ID":"0441002","RUNTIME_SLIDES_PER_PAGE_OVERLAY":"10","RUNTIME_SLIDES_PER_PAGE_LIST":"30","RUNTIME_SLIDES_PER_PAGE_GRID":"5","RUNTIME_USE_SENTRY":"1","RUNTIME_CUSTOM_EVENT_DISPATCHER_URL":"https://oply.hearstapps.com/v1/events","RUNTIME_TRUECAR_SHOPPING_URL":"https://shopping.caranddriver.com","RUNTIME_OPEN_WEB_ENABLED":"1"},"isFallback":false,"dynamicIds":[71624,33928,38287,82012,90200,43594,97738,54297,5441,8917,89053,11966,83802,14139,56978,18920,97166,83828,10066,85879,42765,35802,28436,83414,40207,70109],"gssp":true,"customServer":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script><script id="json-ld" type="application/ld+json">{"@type":"NewsArticle","thumbnailUrl":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.668xw:1.00xh;0.119xw,0&resize=100:*","datePublished":"2023-03-10T22:48:06.656141Z EST","headline":"25 Cute Cat Instagram Captions Because Your Photos Are Already Purrrfect","articleBody":"If you can't resist staging a mini photo shoot every time your cat rolls over, you won't hear any judgment from us. When you've got a furry friend who makes the cutest muffins in the world, we don't blame you for wanting to post a hundred photos every day. Just look at them: those big eyes that stare deep into your soul (especially when you rattle the treat bag), that mischievously twitching tail, that absolutely irresistible furry belly. It's practically a public service to share them with the world!But while filling up your camera role with cuteness is a little too easy, coming up with something to write in the caption can be much tougher. Just typing \"gaaaaah!\" into the text box doesn't have quite the right ring to it. Don't worry, we've got you: These cat Instagram captions will capture your friend's best side, whether your IG tends to feature their most elegant glamour shots or a selection of goofy snaps. We've included some cute and funny captions, as well as cat quotes to help you out. Cute Cat CaptionsNot all heroes wear capes. Some have collars.Yes, I am the cat's meow.With a cat, anything is paw-sible.Why thank you, I am purrrfect.You had me at meow.A cat will be your furever friend.I want to spend all nine lives with you.Home is where the cat is.Funny Cat CaptionsCat hair is my favorite accessory.Feline good, lookin' better.Are you kitten me?She came, she purred, she conquered.I wish I loved anything as much as my cat loves catnip. It's a cat's world, we're just living in it.This kitty's got a bad cattitude.Hooked on a feline.Love has four paws and a twitchy tail. We're just kitten around.Quotes About Cats for Captions“One cat just leads to another.” —Ernest Hemingway“I had been told that the training procedure with cats was difficult. It’s not. Mine had me trained in two days.” —Bill Dana“What greater gift than the love of a cat?” —Charles Dickens“In ancient times, cats were worshiped as gods; they have not forgotten this.” –Terry Pratchett“Meow” means “woof” in cat.” —George Carlin“If cats could talk, they wouldn’t.” —Nan Porter“People who don’t like cats were probably mice in an earlier life.” —Unknown ","wordCount":366,"articleSection":"Life","image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","height":1200,"thumbnail":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.668xw:1.00xh;0.119xw,0&resize=100:*","url":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.668xw:1.00xh;0.119xw,0&resize=1200:*","width":1200},{"@type":"ImageObject","height":900,"thumbnail":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.668xw:1.00xh;0.119xw,0&resize=100:*","url":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.88847xw:1xh;center,top&resize=1200:*","width":1200},{"@type":"ImageObject","height":675,"thumbnail":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=0.668xw:1.00xh;0.119xw,0&resize=100:*","url":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=1xw:0.84415xh;center,top&resize=1200:*","width":1200}],"mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/pets/a43276342/cat-instagram-captions/","@type":"WebPage"},"publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"Good Housekeeping","sameAs":["https://twitter.com/goodhousemag","https://www.tiktok.com/@goodhousekeepingofficial","https://www.youtube.com/c/GoodHousekeeping","https://www.facebook.com/GOODHOUSEKEEPING","http://instagram.com/goodhousekeeping","http://www.pinterest.com/goodhousemag/"],"logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/_assets/design-tokens/goodhousekeeping/static/images/logos/logo-jsonld.e7d28d1.png","width":312,"height":60},"parentOrganization":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"Hearst Corporation"}},"url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/pets/a43276342/cat-instagram-captions/","isBasedOn":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/life/pets/a43276342/cat-instagram-captions/","isAccessibleForFree":"False","hasPart":[{"@type":"WebPageElement","isAccessibleForFree":"False","cssSelector":".content-container"}],"video":{"@type":"VideoObject","contentUrl":"https://streaming.hearstdigitalstudios.com/b7d83adb-9bcc-4aa5-8dd0-651fe40845f7/video_rover_16x9_1080p_hd_1675291134_8027.mp4","description":"Despite the fact that cats are the most popular pet in the world, our feline friends get a lot of bad press. Haters assume that cats are selfish and unfriendly, but these breeds are both calm and cuddly.","duration":"PT2M","embedUrl":"https://glimmer.hearstapps.com/amp.html?embedId=66474da1-eeb1-4c77-92fb-03fff0469095","name":"10 of the Cutest Cat Breeds","thumbnailUrl":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/hmg-prod/images/beautiful-smooth-haired-red-cat-lies-on-the-sofa-royalty-free-image-1678488026.jpg?crop=1xw:0.84415xh;center,top","uploadDate":"2023-03-10T22:39:30.400660Z"},"description":"Your cat's already perfect. With these adorable cat instagram captions, your furry friend's social media presence will be too. ","author":{"name":"Lizz Schumer","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/author/221791/lizz-schumer/","@type":"Person","description":"<p>Lizz (she/her) is a senior editor at <em>Good Housekeeping</em>, where she runs the GH Book Club, edits essays and long-form features and writes about pets, books and lifestyle topics. A journalist for almost two decades, she is the author of <em>Biography of a Body</em> and <em>Buffalo Steel. </em>She also teaches journalism as an adjunct professor at New York University's School of Professional Studies and creative nonfiction at the Muse Writing Center, and coaches with the New York Writing Room.&nbsp;</p>","jobTitle":"Senior Editor","image":"https://hips.hearstapps.com/rover/profile_photos/befb8503-be96-4791-afc0-bc7ab86fca09_1611335589.png","sameAs":[]},"@context":"http://schema.org"}</script></body></html>